'''Bats''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 5th tier in the Main Event during the [[Halloween Event 2018|2018 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is orange with twelve black bats varying in different sizes imprinted on it, hence the name. The guard is orange, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Bats Gun (2018)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Bats_Set Bats Set].

